      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To be fair there have already been a number of complaints regarding the team releasing updates on weekends. This update, thankfully, was released mid week giving them a bit of time to push out some patches without completely ruining the weekend events. \nI don't know every bug that exists from this update but it looks to me as if the regular weekend events are continuing as normal so I'm curious as to what is stopping the other halloween events?\nI can agree though that their release timing in the future could possibly factor in major holidays to allow themselves a little more time rather than a couple of days to put out any fires caused by an update.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
