      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2e2ab863aa6f7311d53d03|full_name}: Good notes. I do wanna add that the follow up from this latest \"Outrage\" from the community has been taken very well from the Dev team and I really do appreciate the work they've done to try and work with the community.",
